# `cargo xtask solve wolfgangsee --write`; the xtask tour coupling test
# checks it), then 800 idle frames: the Maibaum sequence, the tally, the
# route map Wolfgangsee -> Strobl, which has no level yet, so the teaser
# („Fortsetzung folgt …", D-072) and the title (5454) with the run reset.
