# (the scroll starts), sees swan #1 hiss and charge under the deck, swims
# the Seebad with Gelse #1 waiting at the water line behind her, passes
# the lantern pontoon (checkpoint), swims under the Traundl section and
# takes the regatta by diving and a masthead bounce, then the Strobl quay
# and a running jump off the landing hall to the Maibaum.
